://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/02/opinion/puerto-rico-hurricane-maria-death-toll.html', 'snippet': 'The president said the administration did a “fantastic job” in responding to the 2017 storm in Puerto Rico. A new estimate of the death toll says otherwise.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has become customary to gauge the scale of calamities by the official count of the dead. In this perspective, Puerto Rico’s revision of the death toll from last September’s horrific Hurricane Maria to 2,975 from 64 elevates the storm to one of the greatest catastrophes of recent times in the United States, far exceeding Hurricane Katrina and nearly equaling the terrorist attacks of Sept. 11, 2001.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/02/opinion/02puertorico/merlin_143104170_79eea223-ebe3-4f13-95db-61cc791ebe35-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 333, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/02/opinion/02puertorico/merlin_143104170_79eea223-ebe3-4f13-95db-61cc791ebe35-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 333}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/02/opinion/02puertorico/merlin_143104170_79eea223-ebe3-4f13-95db-61cc791ebe35-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 568, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/02/opinion/02puertorico/merlin_143104170_79eea223-ebe3-4f13-95db-61cc791ebe35-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1136, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/02/opinion/02puertorico/02puertorico-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'