90, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38554867-c5a1-5deb-a5c2-e11895e5564b'}, {'abstract': 'Germany’s painful history has become highly personal in a sleepy village, where neighbors are fighting over what to do with a “Hitler bell” in the local church.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/02/world/europe/hitler-bell-swastika-germany-church.html', 'snippet': 'Germany’s painful history has become highly personal in a sleepy village, where neighbors are fighting over what to do with a “Hitler bell” in the local church.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HERXHEIM AM BERG, Germany — After she found out there was a swastika on the church bell, Sigrid Peters refused to continue playing the organ during services.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/03/world/02hitlerbell-p1/merlin_139086957_33ea9e88-682a-434b-a71a-48b8b3ee6528-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/03/world/02hitlerbell-p1/merlin_139086957_33ea9e88-682a-434b-a71a-48b8b3ee6528-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/03/world/02hitlerbell-p1/merlin_139086957_33ea9e88-682a-434b-a71a-48b8b3ee6528-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/03/world/02hitlerbell-p1/merlin_139086957_33ea9e88-682a-434b-a71a-48b8b3ee6528-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/03/world/02hitlerbell-p1/merlin_139086957_33ea9e88-682a