few tough months found a spacious three-bedroom in Brooklyn with great roommates. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/03/realestate/a-couch-surfer-lands-his-perfect-apartment.html', 'snippet': 'He arrived in New York with no job and a friend’s sofa for a home, but after a few tough months found a spacious three-bedroom in Brooklyn with great roommates. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rob Boscacci arrived in New York two summers ago with no job, very little savings and no backup plan if things didn’t work out, besides returning broke to the Bay Area, where he had been working as a film grip and camera assistant. What he did have was a place to stay: his friend’s couch in Greenpoint, Brooklyn. ', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/realestate/09renters-1/09renters-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/09/realestate/09renters-1/09renters-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/realestate/09renters-1/09renters-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/realestate/09renters-1/09renters-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/realestate/09renters-1/09renters-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/09/realestate/09renters-1/09renter