'nyt://article/64739e57-86a9-5861-a5a2-19a5498e0384'}, {'abstract': 'Amid rising clamor for the pontiff to address claims he covered up abuse, Francis extolled the virtues of silence: “The truth is humble, the truth is silent.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/03/world/europe/pope-francis-mccarrick.html', 'snippet': 'Amid rising clamor for the pontiff to address claims he covered up abuse, Francis extolled the virtues of silence: “The truth is humble, the truth is silent.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — As a clamor builds for Pope Francis to respond to the stunning allegations by his former ambassador in Washington that he covered up abuse and lied about a meeting with a prominent opponent to same-sex marriage, the pontiff has extolled the virtues of silence.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/world/04pope1-print/merlin_142956306_f1ed7759-5243-4f21-8cfd-a0ee54cd7f08-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/04/world/04pope1-print/merlin_142956306_f1ed7759-5243-4f21-8cfd-a0ee54cd7f08-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/world/04pope1-print/merlin_142956306_f1ed7759-5243-4f21-8cfd-a0ee54cd7f08-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/world/04pope1-print/merlin_142956306_f1ed7759-5243-4f21-8cfd-a0ee54cd7f08-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url