els me to challenge the way reactionary conservatives have hijacked our faith to serve their narrow interests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/03/opinion/evangelical-brett-kavanaugh-civil-rights.html', 'snippet': 'My faith compels me to challenge the way reactionary conservatives have hijacked our faith to serve their narrow interests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Conservative evangelicals were at the White House last week for an event the Rev. Robert Jeffress described as “a half state dinner and a half campaign rally.” Evangelicals like Mr. Jeffress are ebullient as the Senate prepares to confirm Judge Brett Kavanaugh next week, praising President Trump as “the most pro-life, pro-religious liberty, pro-conservative judiciary president of any president in history.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/03/opinion/03WilsonHartgrove/merlin_141972666_bdb965c1-a75f-434e-a603-09dc6c26587c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/03/opinion/03WilsonHartgrove/merlin_141972666_bdb965c1-a75f-434e-a603-09dc6c26587c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/03/opinion/03WilsonHartgrove/merlin_141972666_bdb965c1-a75f-434e-a603-09dc6c26587c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/03/opinion/03WilsonHartgrove/merlin_141972666_bdb965c1-a75f-434e-a603-09dc6c26587c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1434, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20