ods, Phil Mickelson and Tony Finau squeezed most of the drama out of Tuesday’s announcement with strong showings at the Dell Technologies Championship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/03/sports/ryder-cup-tiger-woods.html', 'snippet': 'Bryson DeChambeau, Tiger Woods, Phil Mickelson and Tony Finau squeezed most of the drama out of Tuesday’s announcement with strong showings at the Dell Technologies Championship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NORTON, Mass. — The Dell Technologies Championship was supposed to serve as a teaser for the news conference on Tuesday in which three of the remaining four United States Ryder Cup picks will be announced. But on a muggy Monday, Bryson DeChambeau, Tiger Woods, Phil Mickelson and Tony Finau squeezed all but the last note of drama out of the announcement from Jim Furyk, the United States captain.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/sports/04GOLFprint1/merlin_143243367_b1eebc88-f64e-4862-8f8c-f951315a84c3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/04/sports/04GOLFprint1/merlin_143243367_b1eebc88-f64e-4862-8f8c-f951315a84c3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/sports/04GOLFprint1/merlin_143243367_b1eebc88-f64e-4862-8f8c-f951315a84c3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/sports/04GOLFprint1/merlin_143243367_b1eebc88-f64e-4862-8f8c-f951315a84c3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':