 'word_count': 1194, 'uri': 'nyt://article/740acee9-83dd-53a0-b01e-ef83136c73b0'}, {'abstract': 'Gov. Doug Ducey, who made the selection, was facing a difficult balancing act in trying to please Trump supporters while not alienating McCain’s family and loyalists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/04/us/politics/arizona-senate-mccain.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Doug Ducey, who made the selection, was facing a difficult balancing act in trying to please Trump supporters while not alienating McCain’s family and loyalists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Gov. Doug Ducey of Arizona on Tuesday appointed former Senator Jon Kyl to fill the seat left open by John McCain’s death, elevating a well-liked former Republican lawmaker who is acceptable to both Mr. McCain’s admirers and forces loyal to President Trump.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/us/05Arizonasenate-promo/05Arizonasenate-promo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/05/us/05Arizonasenate-promo/05Arizonasenate-promo-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/us/05Arizonasenate-promo/05Arizonasenate-promo-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 708, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/us/05Arizonasenate-promo/05Arizonasenate-promo-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1417, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/us/05Arizonasenate-promo/05Arizonasenate-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/05/us/05Arizonasenate-promo/05Arizonasenate-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/us/05Arizonasenate-promo/05Arizonasenate-promo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jon Kyl, Former Senator, Will Replace McCain in Arizona', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Senator Until 2013, Kyl Will Take the Seat Of McCain in Arizona', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2018)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kyl, Jon Llewellyn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCain, John', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ducey, Doug (1964- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-04T16:31:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Martin and Danny Hakim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Danny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hakim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_mate