labour-anti-semitism-corbyn.html', 'snippet': 'Britain’s Labour Party is seeking once and for all to end a rift over anti-Semitism. But the infighting has exposed damaging divisions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — As Prime Minister Theresa May’s government tears itself apart over plans to quit the European Union, there could scarcely be a better time for the opposition Labour Party to exploit the disarray and press its case to govern Britain.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/world/05Labour1/merlin_143251230_170b432a-f55f-4d71-a18e-6cbd1bac1105-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/05/world/05Labour1/merlin_143251230_170b432a-f55f-4d71-a18e-6cbd1bac1105-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 433}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/world/05Labour1/merlin_143251230_170b432a-f55f-4d71-a18e-6cbd1bac1105-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 739, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/world/05Labour1/merlin_143251230_170b432a-f55f-4d71-a18e-6cbd1bac1105-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1478, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/world/05Labour1/05Labour1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/05/world/05Labour1/05Labour1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': N