t-berlin.html', 'snippet': 'From a family-friendly riff on soccer to the Pina Bausch company, Tanz im August runs the stylistic gamut of contemporary dance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Some lounged on deck chairs. Others danced to mellow beats spun by the D.J.s Wahid Paradis and kos_mic q’andi. Dancers, choreographers, programmers and mere mortals stood around with bottles of beer, talking, talking, talking. It was 2 a.m. on Saturday night, and Tanz im August festival’s closing party showed no signs of slowing down.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/arts/04tanz-notebook2/merlin_143223975_0bb544b1-868e-4002-9d6c-3320ea3be075-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/05/arts/04tanz-notebook2/merlin_143223975_0bb544b1-868e-4002-9d6c-3320ea3be075-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/arts/04tanz-notebook2/merlin_143223975_0bb544b1-868e-4002-9d6c-3320ea3be075-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/arts/04tanz-notebook2/merlin_143223975_0bb544b1-868e-4002-9d6c-3320ea3be075-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/arts/04tanz-notebook2/04tanz-notebook2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/05/arts/04tanz-notebook2/04tanz-notebook2-thum