nt. Earlier in the day, he appeared at a Senate hearing with Sheryl Sandberg of Facebook.', 'lead_paragraph': '• Jack Dorsey, Twitter’s chief executive, testified on Wednesday before the House Energy and Commerce Committee about the moderation of online content. The hearing took a more political tone than a Senate hearing earlier in the day, but he avoided taking sides.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/business/06techlivebriefing-opening/merlin_143300877_191e7456-92b8-4120-b403-51eafd90f54d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/06/business/06techlivebriefing-opening/merlin_143300877_191e7456-92b8-4120-b403-51eafd90f54d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/business/06techlivebriefing-opening/merlin_143300877_191e7456-92b8-4120-b403-51eafd90f54d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/business/06techlivebriefing-opening/merlin_143300877_191e7456-92b8-4120-b403-51eafd90f54d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/business/06techlivebriefing-opening/06techlivebriefing-opening-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/06/business/06techlivebriefing-opening/06techlivebriefing-opening-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp