None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sick Fliers Hospitalized After Landing at J.F.K.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Emirates Airlines', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kennedy International Airport (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-05T14:19:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Pager', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pager', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a7f29dae-50a8-55ab-9299-14aedb9bc7fa', 'word_count': 411, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a7f29dae-50a8-55ab-9299-14aedb9bc7fa'}, {'abstract': 'Tomato tonnato! Grab some heirloom tomatoes, a can of good Italian tuna, and go to town.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/05/dining/what-to-cook-right-now.html', 'snippet': 'Tomato tonnato! Grab some heirloom tomatoes, a can of good Italian tuna, and go to town.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Time of wonder, Robert McCloskey called it: summer defined by place and weather and light. You might get a good peach out of it, some terrific corn, a few excellent tomatoes. I’ve had a lot of those, these last few weeks, and it’s made for maybe the best no-recipe cooking of the year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/05/dining/05Romanrex2-copy/merlin_143028852_04c4c45c-4f4f-4185-bb6c-b116f1967579-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/05/dining/05Romanrex2-copy/merlin_143028852_04c4c45c-4f4f-4185-bb6c-b116f196757