National on two new albums filled with tracks in flux.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Swamp Dogg has been keeping unlikely company lately. He’s a 76-year-old songwriter, producer and singer who started recording R&B songs in the 1950s under variations on his given name, Jerry Williams Jr. LSD helped unleash his Swamp Dogg alter ego, whose decades of recordings since 1970 have been lovelorn, raunchy, funny and pointedly political. Until this year, his musical style has been proudly grounded in old-school soul and funk.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/arts/06album-machinedogg-1/06album-machinedogg-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/06/arts/06album-machinedogg-1/06album-machinedogg-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/arts/06album-machinedogg-1/06album-machinedogg-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/arts/06album-machinedogg-1/06album-machinedogg-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/arts/06album-machinedogg-1/06album-machinedogg-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/06/arts/06album-machinedogg-1/06album-machinedogg-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt