ere, a record of success that dates to his election as state treasurer in 1976. And Mr. Carper’s formula for victory has largely remained constant: stay true to a centrist brand of politics that appeals to Delaware’s mix of rural voters and suburbanites while retaining a ubiquitous presence at churches, firehouse fund-raisers and birthday parties to which he may or may not have been invited.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/us/06delaware-1-print/merlin_142712181_216a94e9-603f-4032-8804-4e63c9ab7053-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/06/us/06delaware-1-print/merlin_142712181_216a94e9-603f-4032-8804-4e63c9ab7053-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/us/06delaware-1-print/merlin_142712181_216a94e9-603f-4032-8804-4e63c9ab7053-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/us/06delaware-1-print/merlin_142712181_216a94e9-603f-4032-8804-4e63c9ab7053-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/us/06delaware-1-print/merlin_142712181_216a94e9-603f-4032-8804-4e63c9ab7053-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/06/us/06delaware-1-print/merlin_142712181_216a94e9-603f-4032-8804-4e63c9ab7053-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight