le/67f2af74-1d00-531f-91e1-f241830fa14d'}, {'abstract': 'Judge Brett M. Kavanaugh spent a long day answering — and often failing to answer — questions about some of the most pressing issues that could reach the Supreme Court in the years ahead. Here’s a look at three of them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/05/us/politics/kavanaugh-abortion-guns-presidential-power.html', 'snippet': 'Judge Brett M. Kavanaugh spent a long day answering — and often failing to answer — questions about some of the most pressing issues that could reach the Supreme Court in the years ahead. Here’s a look at three of them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Asked about the constitutional right to abortion, Judge Brett M. Kavanaugh talked instead about precedent. He described the Supreme Court’s two key decisions: Roe v. Wade, the 1973 ruling that established a constitutional right to abortion, and Planned Parenthood v. Casey, the 1992 decision that reaffirmed the core of that right.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/us/politics/06dc-issues-1/merlin_143303613_67e8e500-6e94-4c7f-8afb-f14727478aec-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/06/us/politics/06dc-issues-1/merlin_143303613_67e8e500-6e94-4c7f-8afb-f14727478aec-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/us/politics/06dc-issues-1/merlin_143303613_67e8e500-6e94-4c7f-8afb-f14727478aec-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/us/politics/06dc-issues-1/merlin_143303613_67e8e500-6e94-4c7f-8afb-