ot, the camera pivots to show us what they’re there to see: a “witch camp” in modern Zambia. The “witches,” to all appearances, are merely women living in what looks like an outdoor farm prison, attached to ribbons that restrict them to a certain radius.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/arts/07iamnot/merlin_143158164_887c4c98-5b90-4026-a982-75408eb4dacf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 255, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/07/arts/07iamnot/merlin_143158164_887c4c98-5b90-4026-a982-75408eb4dacf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 255}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/arts/07iamnot/merlin_143158164_887c4c98-5b90-4026-a982-75408eb4dacf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/arts/07iamnot/merlin_143158164_887c4c98-5b90-4026-a982-75408eb4dacf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 869, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/arts/07iamnot/07iamnot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/07/arts/07iamnot/07iamnot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/arts/07iamnot/07iamnot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 