wealth to strengthen the Republican Party and buy the Orlando Magic basketball team.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/06/obituaries/richard-devos-dead-amway.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. DeVos turned the marketing company into a global enterprise and used his wealth to strengthen the Republican Party and buy the Orlando Magic basketball team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Richard M. DeVos, the Amway Corporation co-founder who built and used one of the 20th century’s great personal fortunes to bolster the Republican Party, restore civic vitality to his hometown, Grand Rapids, Mich., and buy the Orlando Magic of the National Basketball Association, died on Thursday. He was 92.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/obituaries/07DEVOS2/merlin_143347074_eab6e935-97f3-491f-9cb7-b3eaab023fba-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/07/obituaries/07DEVOS2/merlin_143347074_eab6e935-97f3-491f-9cb7-b3eaab023fba-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/obituaries/07DEVOS2/merlin_143347074_eab6e935-97f3-491f-9cb7-b3eaab023fba-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/obituaries/07DEVOS2/merlin_143347074_eab6e935-97f3-491f-9cb7-b3eaab023fba-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/obituaries/07DEVOS2/07DEVOS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 