iscussed invoking the amendment, but the talk did not move forward because “no one wanted to precipitate a constitutional crisis.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/06/us/politics/25th-amendment.html', 'snippet': 'The author of an anonymous essay in The New York Times writes that some advisers around President Trump discussed invoking the amendment, but the talk did not move forward because “no one wanted to precipitate a constitutional crisis.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The anonymous author of an Op-Ed article in The New York Times wrote this week that there were “early whispers” among President Trump’s advisers about trying to remove Mr. Trump from the presidency by invoking Section 4 of the 25th Amendment, which provides a process to declare that the president is unfit for office.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/us/politics/07dc-amendment/merlin_138301368_a695335c-21f1-48ab-a817-ad4d0f8e2161-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/07/us/politics/07dc-amendment/merlin_138301368_a695335c-21f1-48ab-a817-ad4d0f8e2161-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/us/politics/07dc-amendment/merlin_138301368_a695335c-21f1-48ab-a817-ad4d0f8e2161-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/us/politics/07dc-amendment/merlin_138301368_a695335c-21f1-48ab-a817-ad4d0f8e2161-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'ca