t': 'The granddaughter of Estée Lauder, and founder of the lifestyle brand Aerin, takes T on a tour of the apartment where she’s lived for 18 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Aerin Lauder, the founder of the beauty and lifestyle brand Aerin, has inhabited the same Upper East Side apartment for 18 years — practically centuries to the typical New Yorker. But why relocate when you have your own dressing room lined in Gracie wallpaper? Lauder recently showed T around her home, where fine art and Nerf guns have miraculously coexisted over the years (she has two sons, now teenagers). Among the highlights: her grandmother Estée Lauder’s pearl ring, a 1959 Mark Rothko work, her pristine all-white kitchen and a study by Gustav Klimt for his famous painting “Portrait of Adele Bloch-Bauer I,” also known as “The Woman in Gold.” All of this, and more, in our video.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-aerin-01/06-aerin-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-aerin-01/06-aerin-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-aerin-01/06-aerin-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-aerin-01/06-aerin-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1150, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/06/t-magazine/fashion/06-aerin-01/06-aerin-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 