, 'word_count': 979, 'uri': 'nyt://article/183d8a0a-c560-5b46-978f-020ef659e555'}, {'abstract': 'These books for the under-4 set brim with humor, great illustrations, lively storytelling and cheerful surprises.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/07/books/review/poor-little-rabbit-jorg-muhle.html', 'snippet': 'These books for the under-4 set brim with humor, great illustrations, lively storytelling and cheerful surprises.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s possible there has never been a better time to be a toddler. True, you have to put up with grown-ups crashing playtime — today’s parents can often be spotted in sandboxes, solemnly instructing their offspring to scoop and dump sand — but on the plus side, the books currently being made for the preschool (and pre-preschool) crowd are setting a new standard for delightfulness, cleverness and flat-out fun.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/books/review/09Russo-01/09Russo-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 615, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/09/books/review/09Russo-01/09Russo-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 615}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/books/review/09Russo-01/09Russo-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/books/review/09Russo-01/09Russo-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1138, 'width': 1111, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/books/review/09Russo-01/09Russo-01-thumbSt