'', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63214e96-1859-5f38-8d43-d0110e5900eb', 'word_count': 2002, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63214e96-1859-5f38-8d43-d0110e5900eb'}, {'abstract': 'Airports in Shanghai, Rome, New York and other major cities, often designed before global warming was fully understood, face a threat from rising seas and extreme weather.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/07/climate/airport-global-warming-kansai.html', 'snippet': 'Airports in Shanghai, Rome, New York and other major cities, often designed before global warming was fully understood, face a threat from rising seas and extreme weather.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a powerful typhoon tore through Japan this week, travelers at Kansai International Airport looked out on a terrifying void: Where they should have seen the runway, they saw only the sea. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/08/climate/08cli-airports-print-dress-1/merlin_143256837_d8029de9-399e-4c17-b014-71e06e8726da-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 343, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/08/climate/08cli-airports-print-dress-1/merlin_143256837_d8029de9-399e-4c17-b014-71e06e8726da-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 343}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/08/climate/08cli-airports-print-dress-1/merlin_143256837_d8029de9-399e-4c17-b014-71e06e8726da-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 585, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/08/climate/08cli-airports-print-dress-1/merlin_143256837_d8029de9-399e-4c17-b014-71e06e8726da-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 117