83a95-e9e7-5f1a-bc0b-fe3f18ec9a52'}, {'abstract': 'Flen, a town with a history of immigration, is following the trend in much of the country, where the far right is expected to win a fifth of the vote.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/07/world/europe/sweden-election-far-right.html', 'snippet': 'Flen, a town with a history of immigration, is following the trend in much of the country, where the far right is expected to win a fifth of the vote.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLEN, Sweden — The entrance to the small mosque is blocked by a gate. A window is badly cracked around a hole from a rock or a BB gun. A sliding metal security door has been painted with a swastika, only partly removed.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/08/world/08sweden-dispatch1-print/merlin_143076378_97706b98-bb64-4daf-b468-10d1a283c9ee-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/08/world/08sweden-dispatch1-print/merlin_143076378_97706b98-bb64-4daf-b468-10d1a283c9ee-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/08/world/08sweden-dispatch1-print/merlin_143076378_97706b98-bb64-4daf-b468-10d1a283c9ee-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/08/world/08sweden-dispatch1-print/merlin_143076378_97706b98-bb64-4daf-b468-10d1a283c9ee-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/08/world/08swede