gn special resources to protect their national museums from the risk of fire and natural disasters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/07/opinion/fire-brazil-national-museum.html', 'snippet': 'Governments around the world should assign special resources to protect their national museums from the risk of fire and natural disasters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tragedy that engulfed the 200-year-old National Museum of Brazil in Rio de Janeiro on Sunday night, turning up to 20 million of its holdings into dust, is an urgent reminder of the need for better safekeeping measures at museums around the world. To put what happened in perspective: It’s as if the entire collection of the British Museum disappeared, twice over, in the blink of an eye.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/opinion/07Parcak/merlin_143215881_20cecc31-7c8d-4b8f-8541-773170c1822c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/07/opinion/07Parcak/merlin_143215881_20cecc31-7c8d-4b8f-8541-773170c1822c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/opinion/07Parcak/merlin_143215881_20cecc31-7c8d-4b8f-8541-773170c1822c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/opinion/07Parcak/merlin_143215881_20cecc31-7c8d-4b8f-8541-773170c1822c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/opinion/07Parcak/07Parcak-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height'