/emergency-room-costs-medical-bills-urgent-care-virtual-care.html', 'snippet': 'Knowing whether to use an urgent care center, a retail clinic, virtual care or the emergency room can make a big difference in cost.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Emergency care has always been expensive. Recently, though, a perfect storm of high-deductible insurance plans, new venues of care such as stand-alone emergency departments, and insurers who deny payment based on retrospective review — that is, based on the patient’s final diagnosis rather than the original complaint — has elevated concerns about cost to a level that might best be described as sticker shock.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/smarter-living/07emergency-room/07emergency-room-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/07/smarter-living/07emergency-room/07emergency-room-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/smarter-living/07emergency-room/07emergency-room-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/smarter-living/07emergency-room/07emergency-room-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1509, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/smarter-living/07emergency-room/07emergency-room-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/07/smarter-living/07emergency-room/07emergency-room-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/07/smarter-living/07emergency-room/07emergency-room-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to (Maybe) Avoid Sticker Shock at the Emergency Room', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emergency Medical Treatment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-07T21:22:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Well', 'section_name': 'Well', 'subsection_name': 'Live', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Klasco, M.D. and Richard Zane, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Klasco', 'qualifier': 'M.D.', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zane', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b3b97018-de29-503d-8228-07b02535d300', 'word_count': 649, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b3b97018-de29-503d-8228-07b02535d300'}, {'abstract': 'In an acerbic order, a federal judge said 32 counties with Puerto Rican populations were obligated to provide Spanish-language sample ballots.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/07/us/politics/florida-election-spanish.html', 'snippet': 'In an acerbic order, a federal judge said 32 counties with Puerto Rican populations were obligated to provide Spanish-language sample ballots.', 'lead_paragraph