ng’ ', 'kicker': 'Fact Check of the Day', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Security (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-07T21:39:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Linda Qiu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Linda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Qiu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/813c4f59-7a11-595c-81c8-7634d2d4e80d', 'word_count': 757, 'uri': 'nyt://article/813c4f59-7a11-595c-81c8-7634d2d4e80d'}, {'abstract': 'Jair Bolsonaro, a far-right presidential candidate, remained in serious condition after a knife attack ratcheted up tensions in the most uncertain vote in years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/07/world/americas/jair-bolsonaro-brazil-stab.html', 'snippet': 'Jair Bolsonaro, a far-right presidential candidate, remained in serious condition after a knife attack ratcheted up tensions in the most uncertain vote in years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SÃO PAULO — The front-runner in Brazil’s presidential election, Jair Bolsonaro, was in a serious but stable condition on Friday, recovering from near-fatal stabbing amid predictions that the attack will lift his standing and ratchet up tensions in the most uncertain vote in years