'uri': 'nyt://article/23d86d03-3f0f-5836-a091-b11e725c8071'}, {'abstract': 'The reversal of the murder convictions of two battered wives was a surprising development in a country that has decriminalized domestic abuse.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/08/world/europe/russia-domestic-abuse.html', 'snippet': 'The reversal of the murder convictions of two battered wives was a surprising development in a country that has decriminalized domestic abuse.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — When Yana Gurcheva and Galina Katorova were arrested for stabbing their husbands to death with kitchen knives after suffering years of domestic abuse, the murder cases stirred hardly a ripple in Russia’s national news media.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/world/09russia-abuse/merlin_139131837_05db5a04-13a4-4b88-b247-bdcab07d30f8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/09/world/09russia-abuse/merlin_139131837_05db5a04-13a4-4b88-b247-bdcab07d30f8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/world/09russia-abuse/merlin_139131837_05db5a04-13a4-4b88-b247-bdcab07d30f8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/world/09russia-abuse/merlin_139131837_05db5a04-13a4-4b88-b247-bdcab07d30f8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/09/world/09russia-abuse/xxrussia-abu