dvises, “Don’t just solve the problem, write the code.” And Lisa Seacat DeLuca, a distinguished engineer at IBM, suggests, “If you can imagine it, it’s possible.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/business/10ADCO03-print/merlin_143414199_39a53427-1c45-4671-8a1f-3e4e813ad7cd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/10/business/10ADCO03-print/merlin_143414199_39a53427-1c45-4671-8a1f-3e4e813ad7cd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/business/10ADCO03-print/merlin_143414199_39a53427-1c45-4671-8a1f-3e4e813ad7cd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/business/10ADCO03-print/merlin_143414199_39a53427-1c45-4671-8a1f-3e4e813ad7cd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/business/10ADCO03-print/merlin_143414199_39a53427-1c45-4671-8a1f-3e4e813ad7cd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/10/business/10ADCO03-print/merlin_143414199_39a53427-1c45-4671-8a1f-3e4e813ad7cd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/business/10ADCO03-print/merlin_143414199_39a53427-1c45-4671-8a1f-3e4e813ad7cd-thumbLarge.jpg', 'he