 she used her rage for the countless women silenced by sexism and racism.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/10/opinion/serena-williams-tennis-usopen.html', 'snippet': 'Rather than remain silent, she insisted on being heard. Rather than contain herself, she used her rage for the countless women silenced by sexism and racism.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’ve never booed so loudly in my life. I was standing in Arthur Ashe Stadium on Saturday at the women’s finals of the United States Open, and I barely could hear Serena Williams. She was protesting an unjust and unnecessary penalty that the chair umpire issued. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/opinion/10Tillet/merlin_143468556_5f79495d-39c1-4bf1-bb55-a5e14edc7213-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/10/opinion/10Tillet/merlin_143468556_5f79495d-39c1-4bf1-bb55-a5e14edc7213-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/opinion/10Tillet/merlin_143468556_5f79495d-39c1-4bf1-bb55-a5e14edc7213-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/opinion/10Tillet/merlin_143468556_5f79495d-39c1-4bf1-bb55-a5e14edc7213-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/10/opinion/10Tillet/10Tillet-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/10/opinion/10Tillet/10