': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/11/us/new-hampshire-primary-election.html', 'snippet': 'Voters will decide which Democrat will challenge a popular governor, and they will select candidates for an open seat in a perennial swing district. Here are the key races. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chris Sununu, a Republican and one of the most popular governors in the country, is regarded as an overwhelming favorite to keep his job. But two Democrats are fighting for the privilege of taking him on in the fall. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12whattowatchNH-nh1/merlin_143322918_e600eda8-49b3-4e7f-8a39-1c6ac1968737-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 315, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12whattowatchNH-nh1/merlin_143322918_e600eda8-49b3-4e7f-8a39-1c6ac1968737-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 315}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12whattowatchNH-nh1/merlin_143322918_e600eda8-49b3-4e7f-8a39-1c6ac1968737-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 537, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12whattowatchNH-nh1/merlin_143322918_e600eda8-49b3-4e7f-8a39-1c6ac1968737-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1074, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12whattowatchNH-nh1/12whattowatchNH-nh1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12whattowatchNH-nh1/12whattowatchNH-nh