 following four storms. Below are tips for navigating travel during the storms and their aftermaths.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/travel/12hurricane-travel/merlin_143601174_91e963a8-861d-4827-b13b-34236b30c166-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/12/travel/12hurricane-travel/merlin_143601174_91e963a8-861d-4827-b13b-34236b30c166-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/travel/12hurricane-travel/merlin_143601174_91e963a8-861d-4827-b13b-34236b30c166-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/travel/12hurricane-travel/merlin_143601174_91e963a8-861d-4827-b13b-34236b30c166-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1458, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/travel/12hurricane-travel/merlin_143601174_91e963a8-861d-4827-b13b-34236b30c166-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/12/travel/12hurricane-travel/merlin_143601174_91e963a8-861d-4827-b13b-34236b30c166-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/travel/12hurricane-travel/merlin_143601174_91e963a8-861d-4827-b13b-34236b30c166-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}