 'word_count': 574, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e33a1fc7-1875-5ab6-9358-8601f1490582'}, {'abstract': 'Influential stylists and makeup artists would most likely say: It’s only a start. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/11/style/beauty-diversity.html', 'snippet': 'Influential stylists and makeup artists would most likely say: It’s only a start. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an era of makeup collections with 40 foundation colors and more spokesmodels of color than ever before, diversity at the beauty counter would seem to be accepted, even celebrated. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/13/fashion/13SKINDEEP-COMBO/13SKINDEEP-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 347, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/13/fashion/13SKINDEEP-COMBO/13SKINDEEP-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 347}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/13/fashion/13SKINDEEP-COMBO/13SKINDEEP-COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/13/fashion/13SKINDEEP-COMBO/13SKINDEEP-COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1184, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/13/fashion/13SKINDEEP-COMBO/13SKINDEEP-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/13/fashion/13SKINDEEP-COMBO/13SKINDEEP-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarg