reme Court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/11/us/politics/brett-kavanaugh-confirmation-vote.html', 'snippet': 'Last week’s confirmation hearings for the Supreme Court nominee Brett M. Kavanaugh injected new energy into efforts to block his ascent to the Supreme Court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Pressure is intensifying on undecided senators before a vote to confirm President Trump’s Supreme Court nominee, with one senator — Susan Collins, Republican of Maine — reporting that she and her staff have been targeted with a barrage of calls, including some using vulgar language and threats to push her to vote against Judge Brett M. Kavanaugh.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12dc-kavanaugh1/merlin_143378517_d7ade32b-d8a2-4f3e-b67e-53a36c1780ef-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12dc-kavanaugh1/merlin_143378517_d7ade32b-d8a2-4f3e-b67e-53a36c1780ef-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12dc-kavanaugh1/merlin_143378517_d7ade32b-d8a2-4f3e-b67e-53a36c1780ef-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12dc-kavanaugh1/merlin_143378517_d7ade32b-d8a2-4f3e-b67e-53a36c1780ef-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/12/us/politics/12dc-kavanaugh1/12dc-kavanaugh1-thumbStandard.