/trump-twitter-white-house-videos.html', 'snippet': 'The president experiments with a new subgenre, in which his hands must do the work of the Caps Lock key.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sept. 11 began like most days for President Trump — with rage-tweets. He complained about his Justice Department. He recapped the previous night’s Lou Dobbs show. He quoted a defense of him against charges of Russian collusion (“nothing to show”). Eventually, he turned to the solemn anniversary, praising his lawyer Rudy Giuliani for being a “TRUE WARRIOR” on 9/11, then added a reflection: “17 years since September 11th!”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15trumpvideos/merlin_143639418_65a8c95e-e3d7-4973-85e7-d7051d0abbd2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15trumpvideos/merlin_143639418_65a8c95e-e3d7-4973-85e7-d7051d0abbd2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15trumpvideos/merlin_143639418_65a8c95e-e3d7-4973-85e7-d7051d0abbd2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15trumpvideos/merlin_143639418_65a8c95e-e3d7-4973-85e7-d7051d0abbd2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15trumpvideos/merlin_143639418_65a8c95e-e3d7-4973-85e7-d7051d0abbd2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': '