estimate Me’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Democrat Warns, ‘Do Not Underestimate Me’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Governors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kelly, Molly (1949- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Hampshire', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Midterm Elections (2018)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-12T19:49:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sydney Ember', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sydney', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ember', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9b6ba61-cc3e-5223-b14b-13816f3a77de', 'word_count': 1248, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9b6ba61-cc3e-5223-b14b-13816f3a77de'}, {'abstract': 'Dozens were injured in the incident in Hunan Province, which the authorities called a “malicious case of intentional driving.” Terrorism was not mentioned as a possible motive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/12/world/asia/deadly-car-attack-china.html', 'snippet': 'Dozens were injured in the incident in Hunan Province, which the authorities called a “malicious case of intentional driving.” Terrorism was not mentioned as a possible motive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At least 11 people were killed and 44 injured on Wednesday night after a man intentionally drove a vehicle into a crowded pedestrian square in a southern Chinese city, according to local officials and state news outlets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Least 11 Die as Driver Plows Into Crowd in China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hunan Province (China)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-12T20:07:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Megan Specia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Megan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Specia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e269de6f-2e7c-58de-8321-bde6130b2d68', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e269de6f-2e7c-58de-8321-bde6130b2d68'}, {'abstract': 'Cutting greenhouse gas emissions is critical to reduce the risks of exposure to extreme weather like the hurricanes now barreling across the Atlantic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/12/opinion/hurricane-greenhouse-gas-carbon-tax.html', 'snippet': 'Cutting greenhouse gas emissions is critical to reduce the risks of exposure to extreme weather like the hurricanes now barreling across the Atlantic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the past few years, we have seen substantial damage from storms and flooding in the United States. Hurricanes Harvey, Irma and Maria, which hit in August and September of last year, cost a combined $265 billion in what was a “historic” year for weather and climate-related disasters, according to the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'ca