usicality), the young rebels around the Judson Memorial Church in New York went further.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '50', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16fallpicksdance-alastair/merlin_141964956_b777efb1-2cff-4ca5-b978-e8a3b04b6d93-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16fallpicksdance-alastair/merlin_141964956_b777efb1-2cff-4ca5-b978-e8a3b04b6d93-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16fallpicksdance-alastair/merlin_141964956_b777efb1-2cff-4ca5-b978-e8a3b04b6d93-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16fallpicksdance-alastair/merlin_141964956_b777efb1-2cff-4ca5-b978-e8a3b04b6d93-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1379, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16fallpicksdance-alastair/16fallpicksdance-alastair-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16fallpicksdance-alastair/16fallpicksdance-alastair-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16fallpicksdance-alastair/16fallpicksdance-alastair-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'