 a surprising primary season reaches what could be a dramatic conclusion in New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/13/nyregion/ny-primary-election-governor-attorney-general-idc.html', 'snippet': 'As voters head to the polls on Thursday, a surprising primary season reaches what could be a dramatic conclusion in New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York voters head to the polls on Thursday as an unusual season of primaries, marked by surprise victories and insurgent candidacies, moves to an end. Voters will choose their party’s nominees for governor, lieutenant governor, attorney general and the State Legislature — and there’s more intrigue than normal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/13/nyregion/13NYWHATTOWATCHsub2/merlin_143670801_6234b858-d581-471c-95a1-3bb42d553f59-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/13/nyregion/13NYWHATTOWATCHsub2/merlin_143670801_6234b858-d581-471c-95a1-3bb42d553f59-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/13/nyregion/13NYWHATTOWATCHsub2/merlin_143670801_6234b858-d581-471c-95a1-3bb42d553f59-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/13/nyregion/13NYWHATTOWATCHsub2/merlin_143670801_6234b858-d581-471c-95a1-3bb42d553f59-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/13/nyregion/13NYWHATTOWATCHsub2/13NYWHATTOWATCHsub2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'w