ing married is stressful and exhausting; give a gift that helps make post-wedding time off more relaxing. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The wedding is over and now it’s time to slow down. What might be a helpful gift for newlyweds looking to switch up their hectic routine? Forget anything digital for the moment. Think more retro — or maybe some pampering is in order. Consider providing a deep-tissue massage for two, or an evening of games or coloring, without electronic disruptions. Here are 10 suggestions that are likely to put couples in a mindful state.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/fashion/weddings/00registry1-triptych/00registry1-triptych-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 212, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/04/fashion/weddings/00registry1-triptych/00registry1-triptych-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 212}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/fashion/weddings/00registry1-triptych/00registry1-triptych-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 362, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/fashion/weddings/00registry1-triptych/00registry1-triptych-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/04/fashion/weddings/00registry1-triptych/00registry1-triptych-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/04/fashion/weddings/00registry1-triptych/00registry1-triptych-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '