}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed6f46a8-7e7d-5186-9e39-43090bed77c2', 'word_count': 116, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed6f46a8-7e7d-5186-9e39-43090bed77c2'}, {'abstract': 'The president dismissed the official death toll of 3,000 from Hurricane Maria, citing far lower numbers, and falsely accused Democrats of inflating the number.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/13/us/politics/trump-denies-puerto-rico-death-roll.html', 'snippet': 'The president dismissed the official death toll of 3,000 from Hurricane Maria, citing far lower numbers, and falsely accused Democrats of inflating the number.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The presidential playbook during times of disaster is pretty well established by now: Consult with emergency officials (and be seen doing so). Express concern for those affected (on camera). Assure the public that the government is ready for whatever comes (whether it is or not).', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/us/14dc-trump-jp-print/merlin_128328824_b33a0aa6-fb17-4389-918a-efdbd59762d3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/14/us/14dc-trump-jp-print/merlin_128328824_b33a0aa6-fb17-4389-918a-efdbd59762d3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/us/14dc-trump-jp-print/merlin_128328824_b33a0aa6-fb17-4389-918a-efdbd59762d3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/us/14dc-trump-jp-print/merlin_128328824_b33a0aa6-fb17-4389-918a-efdbd59762d3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/us/14dc-trump-jp-print/14dc-trump-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/14/us/14dc-trump-jp-print/14dc-trump-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/us/14dc-trump-jp-print/14dc-trump-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As a New Hurricane Roars In, Trump Quarrels Over the Last One', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump Rejects A Storm’s Tally As Gales Blow', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Maria (2017)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Puerto Rico', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Florence (2018)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-13T13:00:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Baker', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cbb52096-71af-5e70-97fa-4f82e8bfbd5c', 'word_count': 1541, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cbb52096-71af-5e70-97fa-4f82e8bfbd5c'}, {'abstract': 'In Nicole Holofcener’s movie, Ben Mendelsohn plays a sad Connecticut dad who blows up his life in the pursuit of something he can’t quite name.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/13/movies/the-land-of-steady-habits-review.html', 'snippet': 'In Nicole Holofcener’s movie, Ben Mendelsohn plays a sad Connecticut dad who blows up his life in the pursuit of something he can’t quite name.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The American suburb is zoned for ambivalence. Neither city nor country, suburbia — at least in the imagination of too many novelists, filmmakers and songwriters to count — yokes affluence to alienation. Beyond the well-kept lawns and hedges are seething hives of adultery, anomie and addiction. These pathologies may not actually be more common along the commuter rail lines than anywhere else, but there is an imposing body of literature that insists otherwise.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14steadyhabits2/merlin_143607480_6dec4fa5-899c-4511-ab6e-ff5c82ce102b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14steadyhabits2/merlin_143607480_6dec4fa5-899c-4511-ab6e-ff5c82ce102b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14steadyhabits2/merlin_143607480_6dec4fa5-899c-4511-ab6e-ff5c82ce102b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14steadyhabits2/merlin_143607480_6dec4fa5-899c-4511-ab6e-ff5c82ce102b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14steadyhabits2/14steadyhabits2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14steadyhabits2/14steadyhabits2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14steadyhabits2/14steadyhabits2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: In ‘The Land of Steady Habits,’ Suburban Malaise, With a Twist', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Public Anomie No. 1', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Land of Steady Habits (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holofcener, Nicole', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mendelsohn, Ben (1969- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, Ted (Author)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-13T13:48:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By A.O. Scott', 'person': [{'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/fe303b99-a061-50d0-a46d-23ce0b621edb', 'word_count': 893, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fe303b99-a061-50d0-a46d-23ce0b621edb'}, {'abstract': 'The two-time Oscar winner stars in his first series, playing a Mars-bound astronaut in a Hulu production from the creator of “House of Cards.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/13/arts/television/the-first-review-sean-penn.html', 'snippet': 'The two-time Oscar winner stars in his first series, playing a Mars-bound astronaut in a Hulu production from the creator of “House of Cards.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The five astronauts of “The First,” when they finally set off for Mars, have the usual payload of scientific experiments and shiny wrenches casually cartwheeling through zero gravity. They also carry another cargo, particular to the series: guilt, recrimination and depression, built up through eight episodes of stylish but tedious and formulaic family drama.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14First2/14First2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14First2/14First2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14First2/14First2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14First2/14First2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14First2/14First2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/14/arts/14First2/14First2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':