 a big debt to Chekhov and O’Casey.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/13/theater/review-the-naturalists-jaki-mccarrick.html', 'snippet': 'Fine performances elevate Jaki McCarrick’s slow-paced Irish drama, which owes a big debt to Chekhov and O’Casey.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are three meals in “The Naturalists,” Jaki McCarrick’s new play at Walkerspace: first TV dinners, then an al fresco spread of pasta and salad, and finally slices of bread squashed together in a sad attempt at sandwiches. There’s also tea and biscuits and enough beer to float the stage.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15naturalists/merlin_143643771_1e2fcf73-7958-4d4d-aefa-a1ca7172be94-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15naturalists/merlin_143643771_1e2fcf73-7958-4d4d-aefa-a1ca7172be94-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15naturalists/merlin_143643771_1e2fcf73-7958-4d4d-aefa-a1ca7172be94-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15naturalists/merlin_143643771_1e2fcf73-7958-4d4d-aefa-a1ca7172be94-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15naturalists/14naturalists1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/15/arts/15