ative talents like Dick Wolf to develop, finance, produce, distribute and market podcasts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Fifty-six percent of Americans have never listened to a podcast. One of Hollywood’s most aggressive companies wants to change that, and it has enlisted Dick Wolf, the king of broadcast television, as part of its campaign.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/business/14podcast-print/14PODCASTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/14/business/14podcast-print/14PODCASTS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/business/14podcast-print/14PODCASTS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/business/14podcast-print/14PODCASTS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1924, 'width': 1283, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/business/14podcast-print/14PODCASTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/14/business/14podcast-print/14PODCASTS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/business/14podcast-print/14PODCASTS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Endeavor, Always Looking to Grow, Starts Podcast Division', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Podcasting Aims for a Whole New Level, and a TV Drama Maestro Joins In', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Endeavor Agency', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gimlet Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Magical Elves', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wolf, Dick', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-13T16:32:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d06ae08-6e6f-56e3-9086-01dbd45ee92a', 'word_count': 829, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d06ae08-6e6f-56e3-9086-01dbd45ee92a'}, {'abstract': 'When I found out I was pregnant at age 24, there was no decision to make. But even if it felt inconsequential at the time, I don’t take for granted that I had a choice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/13/style/abortion-story.html', 'snippet': 'When I found out I was pregnant at age 24, there was no decision to make. But even if it felt inconsequential at the time, I don’t take for granted that I had a choice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I didn’t notice my skipped period. I had switched birth control pills, and my menstrual cycle had always been a little irregular. It wasn’t like a movie, either. When I started vomiting, it didn’t even dawn on me that I was pregnant. I thought it was some symptom of cancer. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'ca