captain and longest-tenured player has been hobbled by injuries for more than two years and will play a last game at home on Sept. 29.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/13/sports/baseball/mets-david-wright-retires.html', 'snippet': 'The team’s captain and longest-tenured player has been hobbled by injuries for more than two years and will play a last game at home on Sept. 29.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For more than two years, David Wright had one goal in mind: to play for the Mets again. He thought his neck and shoulder problems were behind him after multiple operations and that another operation would alleviate some of the pain stemming from a chronic back condition. But as he moved through his protracted rehabilitation, he grudgingly realized that his body could not keep up with his desire to play.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/sports/14mets-web-sub/merlin_143682234_2a58c58e-5883-4eef-b936-fa7909b0b413-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 436, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/14/sports/14mets-web-sub/merlin_143682234_2a58c58e-5883-4eef-b936-fa7909b0b413-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 436}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/sports/14mets-web-sub/merlin_143682234_2a58c58e-5883-4eef-b936-fa7909b0b413-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/14/sports/14mets-web-sub/merlin_143682234_2a58c58e-5883-4eef-b936-fa7909b0b413-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1489, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'captio