-8594-e9182da91423'}, {'abstract': 'Julia Bullock, Conrad Tao, Ashley Fure, Nico Muhly and Hilary Hahn are creating new musical works and reshaping the way we hear old ones.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/14/arts/music/classical-music-faces-to-watch-this-season.html', 'snippet': 'Julia Bullock, Conrad Tao, Ashley Fure, Nico Muhly and Hilary Hahn are creating new musical works and reshaping the way we hear old ones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The classical music season sprawls over centuries and the entire globe, a dizzying array of performances that manages to include both multimillion-dollar productions in front of 4,000 spectators at the Metropolitan Opera and intimate electronic experiments at Issue Project Room in Brooklyn. A balanced cultural diet would include a bit of both, as well as generous helpings of the five artists featured here; we’re particularly looking forward to seeing what they’re up to in the months ahead. They’re musicians who unite virtuosic technique with boundless curiosity, creating new works and reshaping the way we hear old ones. ZACHARY WOOLFE', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '44', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16classical-portraits-promo/merlin_143036655_3291f6e4-ccfd-46da-9813-88f127b7d360-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16classical-portraits-promo/merlin_143036655_3291f6e4-ccfd-46da-9813-88f127b7d360-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/arts/16classical-portraits-promo/merlin_143036655_3291f6e4-ccfd-46da-9813-88f127b7d360-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumb