ml', 'snippet': 'Do it because it may help distract from the dreariness, or because it can help distract someone else. But do take the time to make food for the ones you love.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. It is hard on mornings such as this one, with terrible winds, rain and the Atlantic Ocean bearing down on our neighbors in the Carolinas and surrounding states, to write brightly about the summer pasta (above) you might make this weekend, to serve alongside savory tomato sorbet, with pear kuchen for dessert. Hundreds of thousands have left their homes to seek shelter from Florence’s path, and millions more sit tensely, watching the storm models, looking out at the sky, wondering what’s going to happen, how bad it might be. Adrenaline is the flavor of the day.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/17/dining/17KITCH1/17KITCH1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2015/06/17/dining/17KITCH1/17KITCH1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/17/dining/17KITCH1/17KITCH1-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/17/dining/17KITCH1/17KITCH1-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1386, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2015/06/17/dining/17KITCH1/17KITCH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2015/06/17/dining/17KITCH1/17KITCH1-thumbStandar