2eee64-a677-521c-9324-b8a89deb4f94'}, {'abstract': 'Continuing a pattern of this season, the Yankees struggled to put runners on base and score without homers in a second straight loss to Toronto.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/16/sports/baseball/yankees-blue-jays.html', 'snippet': 'Continuing a pattern of this season, the Yankees struggled to put runners on base and score without homers in a second straight loss to Toronto.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Yankees Manager Aaron Boone, the road to utopia is paved with base runners. He at least said as much before Sunday’s game against the Toronto Blue Jays when asked if he believed his team’s offense relied too much on hitting home runs, the only category in which they lead Major League Baseball.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/17/sports/17skybox-yankees/merlin_143841786_411b7f79-e396-49c1-8176-b1149e1b44d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/17/sports/17skybox-yankees/merlin_143841786_411b7f79-e396-49c1-8176-b1149e1b44d8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/17/sports/17skybox-yankees/merlin_143841786_411b7f79-e396-49c1-8176-b1149e1b44d8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/17/sports/17skybox-yankees/merlin_143841786_411b7f79-e396-49c1-8176-b1149e1b44d8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/17/sports/17skybox-yankees/17skybox-yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/17/sports/17skybox-yankees/17skybox-yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/17/sports/17skybox-yankees/17skybox-yankees-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yankees’ Power Dries Up in Another Dispiriting Loss to the Blue Jays', 'kicker': 'Blue Jays 3, Yankees 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Loss to Jays Shows Void In Offense For Yankees', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toronto Blue Jays', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-16T22:43:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Wallace Matthews', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Wallace', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Matthews', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e9130c81-9403-5f1f-9ef9-222ed1c26197', 'word_count': 825, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9130c81-9403-5f1f-9ef9-222ed1c26197'}, {'abstract': 'The elements offer a rebuke as President Trump rolls back policies designed to address global warming.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/16/opinion/environment/climate-trump-hurricanes-methane.html', 'snippet': 'The elements offer a rebuke as President Trump rolls back policies designed to address global warming.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As if this past summer of merciless heat waves, droughts and megafires were not warning enough, in the past several days the elements sounded another alarm about the state of a world made warmer by the burning of fossil fuels. It came in the form of a one-two punch of wind and rainfall from Hurricane Florence, which like Hurricane Harvey a year ago, has derived much of its wallop from unusually warm ocean waters and stalled weather systems linked to climate change. “Supercharged” is the word one prominent climate scientist, Michael Mann, used to describe Florence, echoing the findings of the federal Global Change report in 2014 that, along with a rise in other extreme weather events, “hurricane intensity and rainfall are projected to increase as the climate continues to warm.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/opinion/16climate/merlin_143738445_959393a7-a36d-4a5b-adff-aa0aa5ad979f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/16/opinion/16climate/merlin_143738445_959393a7-a36d-4a5b-adff-aa0aa5ad979f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 482}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/opinion/16climate/merlin_143738445_959393a7-a36d-4a5b-adff-aa0aa5ad979f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/16/opinion/16climate/merlin_143738445_959393a7-a36d-4a5b-adff-aa0aa5ad979f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1644, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image'