e57fd168e'}, {'abstract': 'Even if smokers don’t light up in the presence of children, residue on objects can cause harm.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/17/well/live/the-risks-to-children-from-adults-who-smoke.html', 'snippet': 'Even if smokers don’t light up in the presence of children, residue on objects can cause harm.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Adults who wish to avoid exposure to secondhand smoke have options. Among my strategies: I don’t allow smoking in my home or car; I have no friends or close family members who smoke; I walk in front of smokers or cross the street to avoid them; I eat inside restaurants; and I hold my breath when passing smokers outside stores and office buildings. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/18/science/18BRODYSMOKE/merlin_143593311_56028448-be41-400f-b576-ad2e86e66d55-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/18/science/18BRODYSMOKE/merlin_143593311_56028448-be41-400f-b576-ad2e86e66d55-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/18/science/18BRODYSMOKE/merlin_143593311_56028448-be41-400f-b576-ad2e86e66d55-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/18/science/18BRODYSMOKE/merlin_143593311_56028448-be41-400f-b576-ad2e86e66d55-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1302, 'width': 1965, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/18/science/18BRODYSMOKE/merlin_143593311_56028