e it — ling cod and spot prawns would be great, if you’re in the California market — but attend to her volumes of garlic and olives. Those are big players in this game.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/19/dining/19Romanrex1-copy/merlin_141970401_4e9c0bdc-cb4d-4d33-80ac-f9808d187cfd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/19/dining/19Romanrex1-copy/merlin_141970401_4e9c0bdc-cb4d-4d33-80ac-f9808d187cfd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/19/dining/19Romanrex1-copy/merlin_141970401_4e9c0bdc-cb4d-4d33-80ac-f9808d187cfd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/19/dining/19Romanrex1-copy/merlin_141970401_4e9c0bdc-cb4d-4d33-80ac-f9808d187cfd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/19/dining/19Romanrex1-copy/19Romanrex1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/19/dining/19Romanrex1-copy/19Romanrex1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/19/dining/19Romanrex1-copy/19Romanrex1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Cook Right Now', 'kicker': 'What to Co