//www.nytimes.com/2018/09/18/obituaries/ehsan-yarshater-dead.html', 'snippet': 'He worked on his magnum opus, an encyclopedia of Iranian history and culture, for more than 40 years, retiring at the letter “K.” The work goes on.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ehsan Yarshater, an eminent Iranian historian who founded and edited the Encyclopedia Iranica, a magnum opus of Iranian history and culture that helped transform the modern understanding of Persian civilization, died on Sept. 2 in Fresno, Calif. He was 98.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/obituaries/21YARSHATER1/13YARSHATER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/21/obituaries/21YARSHATER1/13YARSHATER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/obituaries/21YARSHATER1/13YARSHATER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/obituaries/21YARSHATER1/13YARSHATER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/obituaries/21YARSHATER1/13YARSHATER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/21/obituaries/21YARSHATER1/13YARSHATER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/obituaries/21YARSHATER1/13YARSHATER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ehsan Yarshater, Iran Scholar With a Monumental Vision, Dies at 98', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ehsan Yarshater, 98, Who Began a Vast Accounting of Iran’s History and Culture', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yarshater, Ehsan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Encyclopedias', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Encyclopedia Iranica (Book)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-18T16:51:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amir-Hussein Radjy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amir-hussein', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Radjy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/1790bd19-1d08-5bea-84c8-46513742bd1b', 'word_count': 1044, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1790bd19-1d08-5bea-84c8-46513742bd1b'}, {'abstract': 'Comfort food, colorful dresses and unlimited cocktails are among Molly Goddard’s tips for hosting a memorable evening.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/18/t-magazine/molly-goddard-london-fashion-week-dinner-party.html', 'snippet': 'Comfort food, colorful dresses and unlimited cocktails are among Molly Goddard’s tips for hosting a memorable evening.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Food and wine are just the best things in the world, aren’t they?” the British designer Molly Goddard says with a laugh. Dressed in a matching cardigan and skirt in a kaleidoscopic poppy print, she’s surveying the party she’s throwing at the newly opened Russell Square restaurant Neptune during London Fashion Week. A D.J. is spinning dance hall tracks at a bar festooned with strings of multicolored balloons and draped with rose-pink metallic fringe. At intimate tables of two or four, hungry guests tuck into what Goddard calls “speed” dinners, in which three courses are served within a 40-minute sitting, to allow guests to either stay on and party or head home for an early night. The rest of the 200-strong crowd — a mix of friends, fashion editors, loyal fans of Goddard’s eponymous brand and models fresh from her recent runway show — are dancing to Sean Paul’s “Get Busy.” “We’ve got buckets of beer, wine, prosecco, cocktails. Whatever anyone wants, we have it,” the designer adds with a smile.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/17/t-magazine/17tmag-molly-goddard-slide-2JDY/17tmag-molly-goddard-slide-2JDY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/17/t-magazine/17tmag-molly-goddard-slide-2JDY/17tmag-molly-goddard-slide-2JDY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/17/t-magazine/17tmag-molly-goddard-slide-2JDY/17tmag-molly-goddard-slide-2JDY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/17/t-magazine/17tmag-molly-goddard-slide-2JDY/17tmag-molly-goddard-slide-2JDY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 204