/article/63164306-9364-58fb-af1c-f89871cde03e'}, {'abstract': 'Men tend to walk differently with other men than with women. And Americans walk faster with children, whereas Ugandans move more leisurely.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/19/well/move/faster-slower-how-we-walk-depends-on-who-we-walk-with-and-where-we-live.html', 'snippet': 'Men tend to walk differently with other men than with women. And Americans walk faster with children, whereas Ugandans move more leisurely.', 'lead_paragraph': 'People move differently when they walk in groups than when they walk alone. And their walking style is especially distinct when they walk with children, according to a fascinating new cross-cultural study of pedestrians in several nations. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/well/physed-walk1/physed-walk1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/25/well/physed-walk1/physed-walk1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/well/physed-walk1/physed-walk1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/well/physed-walk1/physed-walk1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/well/physed-walk1/physed-walk1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'ima