n Montgomery and inspired by Birmingham’s mayor, business startups and baseball.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/19/travel/for-roy-wood-jr-alabama-is-painful-history-new-hope-and-home.html', 'snippet': 'The “Daily Show” correspondent is moved by the memorial to lynching victims in Montgomery and inspired by Birmingham’s mayor, business startups and baseball.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In firefighting it’s called a “rekindle”: A blaze thought to be extinguished that later reignites soon after firefighters have left the scene. Failure to find and douse embers smoldering behind walls and flooring leads to rekindles. The only thing that can prevent a rekindle is a thorough overhaul (tearing apart floors, ceilings and furniture). If a firefighter fails to conduct that overhaul, hours later they will be face to face with a second fire that often burns bigger and hotter than the original blaze.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/23/travel/23alabama-roywood1/merlin_143231175_d1b2ba02-a0f5-45b3-9768-7a8de3e731f9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/23/travel/23alabama-roywood1/merlin_143231175_d1b2ba02-a0f5-45b3-9768-7a8de3e731f9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/23/travel/23alabama-roywood1/merlin_143231175_d1b2ba02-a0f5-45b3-9768-7a8de3e731f9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/23/travel/23alabama-roywood1/merlin_143231175_d1b2ba02-a0f5-45b3-9768-7a8de3e731f9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 's