ist notion of “less is more,” he retorted, “Less is a bore,” arguing for ornament, historical references and even humor in architecture.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/19/obituaries/robert-venturi-dead.html', 'snippet': 'To the modernist notion of “less is more,” he retorted, “Less is a bore,” arguing for ornament, historical references and even humor in architecture.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert Venturi, the influential American architect and theorist whose buildings and best-selling books helped inspire the movement known as postmodernism, in which historic elements enliven contemporary forms, died on Tuesday at his home in Philadelphia. He was 93.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/20/obituaries/20VENTURI7/merlin_144006324_e27d220a-e2c8-4d84-85be-f84f4d1481b2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 835, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/20/obituaries/20VENTURI7/merlin_144006324_e27d220a-e2c8-4d84-85be-f84f4d1481b2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 835}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/20/obituaries/20VENTURI7/merlin_144006324_e27d220a-e2c8-4d84-85be-f84f4d1481b2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 621, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/20/obituaries/20VENTURI7/merlin_144006324_e27d220a-e2c8-4d84-85be-f84f4d1481b2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 864, 'width': 621, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/20/obituaries/20VENTURI7/20VENTURI7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,