ity-district-15.html', 'snippet': 'The mayor’s approval of a middle-school diversity plan created by Brooklyn parents highlighted his own hesitation to address segregation citywide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mayor Bill de Blasio stepped into the school desegregation debate on Thursday, by approving a plan to diversify middle schools in one of the city’s 32 school districts and granting $2 million to help other districts come up with their own plans, but the small scale of the actions highlighted just how much he has followed on the issue rather than led.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/nyregion/21district1/merlin_144039354_7375bab4-f457-4b54-813b-49de63030c36-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/21/nyregion/21district1/merlin_144039354_7375bab4-f457-4b54-813b-49de63030c36-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/nyregion/21district1/merlin_144039354_7375bab4-f457-4b54-813b-49de63030c36-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/nyregion/21district1/merlin_144039354_7375bab4-f457-4b54-813b-49de63030c36-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/nyregion/21district1/21district1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/21/nyregion/21district1