t': 1348, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf846b56-fa53-5cc0-bb2d-c101efd3cc0d'}, {'abstract': 'The Camp David Accords were signed 40 years ago. Newly declassified documents show how Israel got its way. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/20/opinion/israel-camp-david-anniversary-carter.html', 'snippet': 'The Camp David Accords were signed 40 years ago. Newly declassified documents show how Israel got its way. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, Israelis and Egyptians commemorate the signing 40 years ago of the Camp David Accords, the agreement that led to the first peace treaty between Israel and an Arab state. Through this peace deal, Egypt secured the return of the Sinai Peninsula, which it had lost in the 1967 War, and Israel neutralized its military threat from the southwest while gaining crucial recognition in the Middle East.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/20/opinion/20anziska1-sub/20anziska1-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/20/opinion/20anziska1-sub/20anziska1-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/20/opinion/20anziska1-sub/20anziska1-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/20/opinion/20anziska1-sub/20anziska1-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/20/opinion/20anziska1-sub/20anziska1-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thum