linebacker and six other players created Through Our Eyes to show the world that people of color love to travel. Charity work is an important part of every trip.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/21/travel/brandon-marshall-travel-charity.html', 'snippet': 'The Broncos linebacker and six other players created Through Our Eyes to show the world that people of color love to travel. Charity work is an important part of every trip.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The idea for the nonprofit Through Our Eyes started when seven African-American N.F.L. players, all good friends, took a ski vacation together to Steamboat Springs, Colo., in 2015. The men, including the Denver Broncos linebacker Brandon Marshall, the New York Giants cornerback William Gay and the former New England Patriots cornerback Tony Carter, spent their days on the slopes and their nights indulging in delicious meals. While they ate, they often had lively discussions about how people of color were stereotyped as non-travelers.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/23/travel/23qna-marshall-1/23qna-marshall-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/23/travel/23qna-marshall-1/23qna-marshall-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/23/travel/23qna-marshall-1/23qna-marshall-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 490, 'width': 750, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/23/travel/23qna-marshall-1/23qna-marshall-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 490, 'width': 750, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, 