eon, offering movies, original series and more. Is it worth the cost?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/21/watching/dc-universe-comics-stream-batman-superman.html', 'snippet': 'The new service is dedicated to Batman, Wonder Woman and the rest of the DC pantheon, offering movies, original series and more. Is it worth the cost?', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the battle for spandex supremacy rages on, the latest gambit comes from DC Entertainment: a subscription streaming service dedicated exclusively to DC content. (Marvel, for now, can rely on a little upstart called Netflix to host much of its original content.) DC Universe debuted last weekend, and thus far its selection of contemporary blockbusters is relatively humble. But the service runs deep with more obscure and retro offerings, with several original scripted series on the way.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/watching/batman-the-animated-series-watching/21dc-stream-slide-H1MA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 319, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/21/watching/batman-the-animated-series-watching/21dc-stream-slide-H1MA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 319}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/watching/batman-the-animated-series-watching/21dc-stream-slide-H1MA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 545, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/watching/batman-the-animated-series-watching/21dc-stream-slide-H1MA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1090, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image