//www.nytimes.com/2018/09/21/us/politics/beto-cruz-debate.html', 'snippet': 'The Texas political rivals spent weeks preparing for the debate, the first of three in their Senate race, which is one of the tightest and most heated this year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DALLAS — Senator Ted Cruz sought to revive his struggling bid for re-election on Friday night, using the first debate with his opponent, Representative Beto O’Rourke, as a referendum on Texas values on issues like the criminal justice system and immigration as he tried to gain the upper hand in a familiar setting against a less-experienced opponent.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/22/us/politics/22cruzbeto-debate-01/merlin_144108843_ea746797-d52d-43f6-937c-f784d0215ce6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/22/us/politics/22cruzbeto-debate-01/merlin_144108843_ea746797-d52d-43f6-937c-f784d0215ce6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/22/us/politics/22cruzbeto-debate-01/merlin_144108843_ea746797-d52d-43f6-937c-f784d0215ce6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/22/us/politics/22cruzbeto-debate-01/merlin_144108843_ea746797-d52d-43f6-937c-f784d0215ce6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/22/us/politics/22cruzbeto-debate-01/22cruzbeto-debate-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'widt