 grandeur as its small moments of daily life — the roadside novelty, the trimmed shrubbery, the man in a business suit on an empty beach — died on Friday at his home in Point Richmond, Calif. He was 76.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/obituaries/25wesselt2/merlin_144101778_20200eb3-029b-4435-bd93-9529d870f507-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/25/obituaries/25wesselt2/merlin_144101778_20200eb3-029b-4435-bd93-9529d870f507-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/obituaries/25wesselt2/merlin_144101778_20200eb3-029b-4435-bd93-9529d870f507-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/obituaries/25wesselt2/merlin_144101778_20200eb3-029b-4435-bd93-9529d870f507-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/obituaries/25wesselt2/24wesselobit2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/25/obituaries/25wesselt2/24wesselobit2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/obituaries/25wesselt2/24wesselobit2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Henry Wessel, Whose Lens Captured Life in the West, Is Dead at 76', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Henry Wessel, 76, Dies; His Lens Caught the West', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wessel, Henry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-24T19:07:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Philip Gefter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Philip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gefter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/df54c66c-e1d0-587f-b7d9-d662d82afb44', 'word_count': 1141, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df54c66c-e1d0-587f-b7d9-d662d82afb44'}, {'abstract': 'Sexual assault is excused as normal and forgivable. It’s not. Ask the women who’ve experienced it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/24/opinion/kavanaugh-sexual-assault-blasey-testimony.html', 'snippet': 'Sexual assault is excused as normal and forgivable. It’s not. Ask the women who’ve experienced it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have a story. So many women do. Mine took place when I was 6 or 7 years old, I think. I wasn’t raped. People seem to always want to parse the details, so I’ll be clear about that. Two older boys, sons of friends of my parents, coerced me into letting them touch my genitals with theirs. They said they would give me money if I let them. When I balked, they called me chicken.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/24/opinion/24Brown/24Brown-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name':