'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c43f686a-b33f-57e4-b95e-6c199adfc782', 'word_count': 1728, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c43f686a-b33f-57e4-b95e-6c199adfc782'}, {'abstract': 'That scenario helps explain why President Trump and Senator Mitch McConnell are so determined to push through Brett Kavanaugh rather than replace him with a less damaged candidate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/25/us/politics/trump-kavanaugh-supreme-court-nomination.html', 'snippet': 'That scenario helps explain why President Trump and Senator Mitch McConnell are so determined to push through Brett Kavanaugh rather than replace him with a less damaged candidate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As President Trump fights for confirmation of Judge Brett M. Kavanaugh to the Supreme Court, the stakes go beyond the fate of this particular conservative nominee. At risk for Mr. Trump is his ability to install any more conservatives on the court at all.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/us/politics/26dc-nomination-print/merlin_144236604_4f6298f4-d0b2-4e39-b6db-d0a28f3fccd7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/26/us/politics/26dc-nomination-print/merlin_144236604_4f6298f4-d0b2-4e39-b6db-d0a28f3fccd7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/us/politics/26dc-nomination-print/merlin_144236604_4f6298f4-d0b2-4e39-b6db-d0a28f3fccd7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/us