 nettlesome issues, ranging from Iran’s nuclear program to North Korea to wars in the Middle East.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump, whose apocalyptic speech in his United Nations debut last year riveted much of the world’s attention, spoke again on the world’s most important diplomatic stage on Tuesday, at the organization’s New York headquarters. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/world/26TRUMP-copy/26TRUMP-copy-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/25/world/26TRUMP-copy/26TRUMP-copy-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/world/26TRUMP-copy/26TRUMP-copy-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/world/26TRUMP-copy/26TRUMP-copy-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/world/26TRUMP-copy/26TRUMP-copy-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/25/world/26TRUMP-copy/26TRUMP-copy-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/25/world/26TRUMP-copy/26TRUMP-copy-thumbLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. General Assembly Updates: Trump Speaks Out on Globalization', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'General Assembly (UN)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-25T10:05:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f544dce-aa6e-52da-9678-a785acf35acd', 'word_count': 2435, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f544dce-aa6e-52da-9678-a785acf35acd'}, {'abstract': 'Large doses of an omega-3 fatty acid in fish oil sharply reduced the rate of cardiovascular events in people with a history of heart disease or Type 2 diabetes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/25/well/fish-oil-heart-attack-stroke-triglycerides-omega-3s.html', 'snippet': 'Large doses of an omega-3 fatty acid in fish oil sharply reduced the rate of cardiovascular events in people with a history of heart disease or Type 2 diabetes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cardiologists may one day have a new tool to help prevent heart attacks and strokes in some high-risk patients: a prescription drug that contains large doses of EPA, an omega-3 fatty acid contained in fish oil.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/10/02/well/24fishoil/24fishoil-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/10/02/well/24fishoil/24fishoil-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype