on sentence spread, accusers and others reacted to the verdict.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/25/arts/television/reactions-to-the-cosby-verdict-accusers-and-allies-speak.html', 'snippet': 'As news of Bill Cosby’s prison sentence spread, accusers and others reacted to the verdict.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The eyes of America were on Bill Cosby on Tuesday as his trial ended with a  three-to-10-year prison sentence for drugging and sexually assaulting a woman at his home in 2004. In the highly anticipated hearing in Montgomery County Court in Pennsylvania, Judge Steven T. O’Neill also remanded Mr. Cosby to custody immediately and denied his request to be released on bail pending appeal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/arts/26COSBY-REAXPIX1/merlin_144319407_87d6c1b0-0e46-4173-aab6-493f68e7972a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/26/arts/26COSBY-REAXPIX1/merlin_144319407_87d6c1b0-0e46-4173-aab6-493f68e7972a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/arts/26COSBY-REAXPIX1/merlin_144319407_87d6c1b0-0e46-4173-aab6-493f68e7972a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/arts/26COSBY-REAXPIX1/merlin_144319407_87d6c1b0-0e46-4173-aab6-493f68e7972a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/arts/26COSBY-REAXPIX1/merlin_144319407_87d6c