5933-98b6-a4a1023d187e'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Putnam spent decades bringing New York’s maritime history to life as a resident museum historian and an impersonator of the author of “Moby-Dick.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/25/obituaries/john-putnam-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Putnam spent decades bringing New York’s maritime history to life as a resident museum historian and an impersonator of the author of “Moby-Dick.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'John Putnam, an expert on New York City’s maritime and commercial history whose impersonations of Herman Melville delighted visitors to the South Street Seaport Museum for decades, died on Sept. 9 in Staten Island. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/obituaries/26PUTNAM1/merlin_144309648_fd3ec77d-3c8a-4aad-87f0-42c178d5f9f2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/26/obituaries/26PUTNAM1/merlin_144309648_fd3ec77d-3c8a-4aad-87f0-42c178d5f9f2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/obituaries/26PUTNAM1/merlin_144309648_fd3ec77d-3c8a-4aad-87f0-42c178d5f9f2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/obituaries/26PUTNAM1/merlin_144309648_fd3ec77d-3c8a-4aad-87f0-42c178d5f9f2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/obituaries/26PUTNAM1/26PUTNAM1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wi