interest rates for the third time this year and signaled it was on track to raise them again in December.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/26/us/politics/federal-reserve-raises-interest-rates.html', 'snippet': 'The Federal Reserve raised interest rates for the third time this year and signaled it was on track to raise them again in December.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Federal Reserve’s chairman, Jerome H. Powell, said on Wednesday that the American economy was experiencing “a particularly bright moment” as the Fed announced a widely expected increase in its benchmark interest rate and signaled that it planned to continue raising rates.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/business/27dc-fed/merlin_141446955_00a47d80-b0cc-4456-a674-c56fca37d9d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/27/business/27dc-fed/merlin_141446955_00a47d80-b0cc-4456-a674-c56fca37d9d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/business/27dc-fed/merlin_141446955_00a47d80-b0cc-4456-a674-c56fca37d9d2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/business/27dc-fed/merlin_141446955_00a47d80-b0cc-4456-a674-c56fca37d9d2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/business/27dc-fed/27dc-fed-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 