al views, tend to be the most biased readers, research shows. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/26/upshot/biased-news-media-or-biased-readers-an-experiment-on-trust.html', 'snippet': 'Those who are most distrustful of the news media, and those with more extreme political views, tend to be the most biased readers, research shows. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gallup survey data indicates that Americans are increasingly distrustful about potentially biased news. They might also want to worry about the partiality of their own judgment as well as how their news consumption habits may affect it.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/22/upshot/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230-articleLarge.png', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/22/upshot/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/22/upshot/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230-jumbo.png', 'height': 723, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/22/upshot/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1185, 'width': 1679, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/22/upshot/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230/26up-mediabias2-1537513534230-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thu