gation and their reporting process. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/26/reader-center/putin-russia-investigation-questions.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Mazzetti and Scott Shane answer readers’ questions on Russian interference in the 2016 election, the Mueller investigation and their reporting process. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Times published a five-chapter special section last week elucidating the Trump-Russia story. The mammoth undertaking, by our investigative reporters Mark Mazzetti and Scott Shane, comprehensively lays out the key plot points and details of Moscow’s interference in the 2016 election — and what we’ve learned over the past two years. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/reader-center/27readers-russia-questions/merlin_142743066_fea69b02-ee9c-453d-b0ac-5037a6b7fb93-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 355, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/27/reader-center/27readers-russia-questions/merlin_142743066_fea69b02-ee9c-453d-b0ac-5037a6b7fb93-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 355}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/reader-center/27readers-russia-questions/merlin_142743066_fea69b02-ee9c-453d-b0ac-5037a6b7fb93-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 606, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/reader-center/27readers-russia-questions/merlin_142743066_fea69b02-ee9c-453d-b0ac-5037a6b7fb93-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1211, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/reader-center/27readers-russia-questions/m