t pan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/26/dining/what-to-cook-right-now.html', 'snippet': 'Make Julia Moskin’s latest, the result of a deep dive into chicken Francese, or freestyle, using our new guide to cooking with a sheet pan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. Julia Moskin was part of The New York Times team that won the Pulitzer Prize for public service this year for reporting on workplace sexual harassment. She is also one of the great food writers of the modern age, a ferocious reporter whose prose is wry and wise and funny and smart. You may have read her treatise last week on the rise of ranch dressing. I hope you avail yourself of her foolproof and fantastic method for pan-frying fish.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/dining/26Chickenrex1-copy/merlin_143907327_92230702-6892-4887-8d5c-5083c94d907b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/26/dining/26Chickenrex1-copy/merlin_143907327_92230702-6892-4887-8d5c-5083c94d907b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/dining/26Chickenrex1-copy/merlin_143907327_92230702-6892-4887-8d5c-5083c94d907b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/dining/26Chickenrex1-copy/merlin_143907327_92230702-6892-4887-8d5c-5083c94d907b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/26/dining/26Chickenrex1-copy/26Chickenrex1-thumbStandard.j