': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5435c3aa-b9e4-5209-ae5e-401c91ed2483', 'word_count': 1213, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5435c3aa-b9e4-5209-ae5e-401c91ed2483'}, {'abstract': 'Senator John Kennedy of Louisiana, a member of the Judiciary Committee, urges his fellow Republicans to avoid turning Thursday’s hearing into a spectacle. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/26/us/politics/kavanaugh-blasey-ford-john-kennedy.html', 'snippet': 'Senator John Kennedy of Louisiana, a member of the Judiciary Committee, urges his fellow Republicans to avoid turning Thursday’s hearing into a spectacle. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In a political climate that allows little tolerance for nuance, Senator John Kennedy of Louisiana has been trying to thread the needle.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/us/politics/27kennedyqa/merlin_143324553_00dad0de-42e5-4861-801a-c82b83cd1af7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/27/us/politics/27kennedyqa/merlin_143324553_00dad0de-42e5-4861-801a-c82b83cd1af7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/us/politics/27kennedyqa/merlin_143324553_00dad0de-42e5-4861-801a-c82b83cd1af7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/us/politics/27kennedyqa/merlin_143324553_00dad0de-42e5-4861-801a-c82b83cd1af7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/us/politics/27kenn