article/848cd8cb-61e1-5fe4-8553-fd07d1c73e2d'}, {'abstract': 'Fan interference contributed to a Pittsburgh rally, but Chicago had already qualified for postseason play thanks to a St. Louis loss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/27/sports/mlb-playoff-standings.html', 'snippet': 'Fan interference contributed to a Pittsburgh rally, but Chicago had already qualified for postseason play thanks to a St. Louis loss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Cubs fan made a valiant attempt to be the team’s new Steve Bartman, but Chicago still emerged with a win this time, and that victory coupled with Milwaukee’s win over St. Louis left the 10-team playoff field nearly set. With both the Brewers and Cubs guaranteed spots, there are now three teams battling for the two remaining playoff berths. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/sports/27baseball-cubs/merlin_144395523_ea72760c-23a7-4bb5-b615-070c1360025f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/27/sports/27baseball-cubs/merlin_144395523_ea72760c-23a7-4bb5-b615-070c1360025f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/sports/27baseball-cubs/merlin_144395523_ea72760c-23a7-4bb5-b615-070c1360025f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/27/sports/27baseball-cubs/merlin_144395523_ea72760c-23a7-4bb5-b615-070c1360025f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': N