cals when traveling, but actual suggestions on how to do that tend to be vague. Here are our tips.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/27/travel/how-to-actually-eat-like-a-local-while-traveling.html', 'snippet': 'Everyone says you should follow the lead of locals when traveling, but actual suggestions on how to do that tend to be vague. Here are our tips.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When looking for restaurant recommendations at home, we rely on friends, magazines and review sites. Yet when abroad, we fantasize about a mystical “local,” someone who will guide us to the best meal of our lives, preferably somewhere “authentic” and “off the beaten path.” Though we would never expect this of a stranger on the street at home, we expect it abroad from citizens just like us. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/travel/30TIPS/merlin_144247674_2e205d60-57f0-421c-badf-b28ed21082e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/30/travel/30TIPS/merlin_144247674_2e205d60-57f0-421c-badf-b28ed21082e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/travel/30TIPS/merlin_144247674_2e205d60-57f0-421c-badf-b28ed21082e0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 735, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/travel/30TIPS/merlin_144247674_2e205d60-57f0-421c-badf-b28ed21082e0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 735, 'width': 735, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/t