” composed by Missy Mazzoli, with a libretto by Royce Vavrek, is about a settler family struggling for survival on the Nebraska plains.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/27/arts/music/review-proving-up-missy-mazzoli.html', 'snippet': '“Proving Up,” composed by Missy Mazzoli, with a libretto by Royce Vavrek, is about a settler family struggling for survival on the Nebraska plains.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A tense and creepy journey into the heart of Manifest Destiny’s darkness, the opera “Proving Up” instructs us, teeth clenched, that the American dream eludes even — especially — those who give everything to gain it.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/arts/28provingup1/merlin_144408780_42160977-a212-43e7-9613-5a82e7d7584b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/28/arts/28provingup1/merlin_144408780_42160977-a212-43e7-9613-5a82e7d7584b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/arts/28provingup1/merlin_144408780_42160977-a212-43e7-9613-5a82e7d7584b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/arts/28provingup1/merlin_144408780_42160977-a212-43e7-9613-5a82e7d7584b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/arts/28provingup1/28provingup1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'l