ct': 'For all their experience in the Ryder Cup, neither has sampled victory in the tournament when it is held in Europe. Now comes another chance, starting Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/27/sports/ryder-cup-woods-mickelson.html', 'snippet': 'For all their experience in the Ryder Cup, neither has sampled victory in the tournament when it is held in Europe. Now comes another chance, starting Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAINT-QUENTIN-EN-YVELINES, France — Tiger Woods and Phil Mickelson have combined for 123 PGA Tour victories and 19 major championships. They are regulars in Forbes’s list of highest-grossing athletes, with followings that could rival those of a boy band. But for all their acclaim and accomplishments, their careers contain an Atlantic Ocean-sized gap: Neither has been part of a winning Ryder Cup team on foreign soil.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/sports/28ryderweb-3/merlin_144286620_4448827e-1a8a-45cc-b472-748deed506c7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/28/sports/28ryderweb-3/merlin_144286620_4448827e-1a8a-45cc-b472-748deed506c7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/sports/28ryderweb-3/merlin_144286620_4448827e-1a8a-45cc-b472-748deed506c7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 712, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/sports/28ryderweb-3/merlin_144286620_4448827e-1a8a-45cc-b472-748deed506c7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1424, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption'