f friends who had convened to support her and zealously protect her privacy, Dr. Blasey said her piece.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/27/us/politics/christine-blasey-ford-testimony.html', 'snippet': 'Surrounded by her lawyers, publicists and a sisterhood of friends who had convened to support her and zealously protect her privacy, Dr. Blasey said her piece.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — She was terrified. She did not want to be there. She was badly in need of caffeine.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-blasey-sub/merlin_144425439_e6b33c0b-aaab-46ed-bb90-5e92328520be-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-blasey-sub/merlin_144425439_e6b33c0b-aaab-46ed-bb90-5e92328520be-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-blasey-sub/merlin_144425439_e6b33c0b-aaab-46ed-bb90-5e92328520be-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-blasey-sub/merlin_144425439_e6b33c0b-aaab-46ed-bb90-5e92328520be-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-blasey-sub/28dc-blasey-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-blasey-sub/28dc-blasey-sub