t trial, part theater, part therapy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/27/us/kavanaugh-hearing.html', 'snippet': 'Tears, rage, partisanship: The Senate Judiciary Committee hearing of Christine Blasey Ford and Brett Kavanaugh was part trial, part theater, part therapy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The voices carried everywhere, quavering but firm.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-scene1/merlin_144426807_b5b208ee-1430-439d-aecc-ba64c583c6ca-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-scene1/merlin_144426807_b5b208ee-1430-439d-aecc-ba64c583c6ca-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-scene1/merlin_144426807_b5b208ee-1430-439d-aecc-ba64c583c6ca-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-scene1/merlin_144426807_b5b208ee-1430-439d-aecc-ba64c583c6ca-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-scene1/28dc-scene1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-scene1/28dc-scene1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/politics/28dc-scene1/28dc-scene1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Voices Pierce Washington: ‘I Am Terrified.’ ‘I Am Innocent.’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Day When Emotions Ran High, Both Inside and Outside of the Capitol', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ford, Christine Blasey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kavanaugh, Brett M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate Committee on the Judiciary', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-28T00:55:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba10b889-1de2-58cb-ab0d-84dd68129954', 'word_count': 1225, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba10b889-1de2-58cb-ab0d-84dd68129954'}, {'abstract': 'As Christine Blasey Ford and Judge Brett M. Kavanaugh gave their accounts in eight hours of tears, anger and exasperation, it seemed the country could not look away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/27/us/reaction-to-kavanaugh-hearing.html', 'snippet': 'As Christine Blasey Ford and Judge Brett M. Kavanaugh gave their accounts in eight hours of tears, anger and exasperation, it seemed the country could not look away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLORADO SPRINGS — Travelers on airplanes cried as they watched it on their seatback televisions. College students holed up all day at library computers and streamed it on their phones, drowning out their lectures. Friends sat together, stunned and still, on living room couches. Television screens at nail salons, sports bars and hotel lobbies were tuned to nothing else.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/28kavanaugh-nation/merlin_144447408_7f015e41-e632-412b-b9d2-6d76e6715f63-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/28/us/28kavanaugh-nation/merlin_144447408_7f015e41-e632-412b-b9d2-6d76e6715f63-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/28kavanaugh-nation/merlin_144447408_7f015e41-e632-412b-b9d2-6d76e6715f63-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/28kavanaugh-nation/merlin_144447408_7f015e41-e632-412b-b9d2-6d76e6715f63-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/28kavanaugh-nation/28kavanaugh-nation-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/28/us/28kavanaugh-nation/28kavanaugh-nation-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/us/28kavanaugh-nation/28kavanaugh-nation-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Nation Transfixed as Emotional Testimony in Kavanaugh Hearing Unfolds', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'On Planes, in Bars, Around Phones, a Nation Is Transfixed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ford, Christine Blasey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kavanaugh, Brett M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-28T00:59:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Healy and Farah Stockman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Farah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stockman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4a427b1-08b4-5e22-bc90-bbf8d9207422', 'word_count': 1129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4a427b1-08b4-5e22-bc90-bbf8d9207422'}, {'abstract': 'And why Christine Blasey Ford was.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/27/opinion/why-brett-kavanaugh-wasnt-believable.html', 'snippet': 'And why Christine Blasey Ford was.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What a study in contrasts: Where Christine Blasey Ford was calm and dignified, Brett Kavanaugh was volatile and belligerent; where she was eager to respond fully to every questioner, and kept worrying whether she was being “helpful” enough, he was openly contemptuous of several senat