tes and union leaders wonder if the city will make it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the shadow of an elevated train line in the South Bronx, a short brick building partially topped with barbed wire is being fortified. Porcelain toilets have been replaced with steel ones so they cannot be broken and used as weapons. Cell doors are now heavier and swing out, to prevent the doors from being blocked by those inside. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/nyregion/28raisetheage1/merlin_143553639_d7f8c7a1-cce5-42e5-a423-0c989f08c3f4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/28/nyregion/28raisetheage1/merlin_143553639_d7f8c7a1-cce5-42e5-a423-0c989f08c3f4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/nyregion/28raisetheage1/merlin_143553639_d7f8c7a1-cce5-42e5-a423-0c989f08c3f4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/nyregion/28raisetheage1/merlin_143553639_d7f8c7a1-cce5-42e5-a423-0c989f08c3f4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/nyregion/28raisetheage1/28raisetheage1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/28/nyregion/28raisetheage1/28raisetheage1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge