5f630b0e-946e-54bb-9150-dbe88beacb85'}, {'abstract': 'The appointment of Marcello Foa has raised alarms and marks a victory of the populist parties over the establishment media that once discounted them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/28/world/europe/italy-journalist-rai.html', 'snippet': 'The appointment of Marcello Foa has raised alarms and marks a victory of the populist parties over the establishment media that once discounted them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Marcello Foa has spread the claim that Hillary Clinton attended a satanic dinner. He broke the news on his blog of a full-scale American military mobilization that never happened. A fan of the Russian leader Vladimir V. Putin and a guest on Russia Today, he doubts the evidence that Moscow’s operatives poisoned a former Soviet spy because it is “too obvious.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/world/28italy-1-print/merlin_141940272_61c82a9d-e825-47fa-9575-afc729ae3cd7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/28/world/28italy-1-print/merlin_141940272_61c82a9d-e825-47fa-9575-afc729ae3cd7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/world/28italy-1-print/merlin_141940272_61c82a9d-e825-47fa-9575-afc729ae3cd7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/world/28italy-1-print/merlin_141940272_61c82a9d-e825-47fa-9575-afc729ae3cd7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt