hy Did He Return to College? His Secret Is Closely Held', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fairleigh Dickinson University', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Widows and Widowers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elderly', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-28T10:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vincent M. Mallozzi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vincent', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f376f676-e685-51ce-b8d7-87d0a561c935', 'word_count': 1567, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f376f676-e685-51ce-b8d7-87d0a561c935'}, {'abstract': 'Their bargain with Trump was simple: They would get tax cuts for the well-connected and a right-wing majority on the Supreme Court. Oh, but the price has gone up.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/28/opinion/kavanaugh-hearing-republicans.html', 'snippet': 'Their bargain with Trump was simple: They would get tax cuts for the well-connected and a right-wing majority on the Supreme Court. Oh, but the price has gone up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you put a man in the White House who openly boasts of being a sexual predator, a president credibly accused by more than a dozen people of misconduct, you are no friend of women and the good men who love them.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/28/opinion/28eganWeb/merlin_144444222_54f5cc51-1bc4-4b43-b9b