'Krieger, Mike', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Systrom, Kevin', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zuckerberg, Mark E', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-28T15:51:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Can Duruk', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Can', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Duruk', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/77be1826-9e5c-5d2f-b6a5-d220b19f4005', 'word_count': 1099, 'uri': 'nyt://article/77be1826-9e5c-5d2f-b6a5-d220b19f4005'}, {'abstract': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission is seeking to bar Mr. Musk from ever serving as an officer or director of a public company.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/28/business/elon-musk-tesla-sec-ban.html', 'snippet': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission is seeking to bar Mr. Musk from ever serving as an officer or director of a public company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Securities and Exchange Commission has accused Elon Musk, Tesla’s chief executive, of committing fraud when he said on Twitter: “Am considering taking Tesla private at $420. Funding secured.” The S.E.C. says Mr. Musk had not had specific conversations about financing when he made that announcement, and so his tweet amounted to a false public statement with the potential to harm investors. It is seeking to prevent Mr. Musk from ever serving as an officer or director of a public company again, which is the most serious penalty the regulator can seek. (Criminal charges, if any, would be brought by the Department of Justice in a separate case.)', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/29/business/29barred/merlin_144469890_88ac5b4b-6a80-4156-888f-dde60e546cbe-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/29/business/29barred/merlin_144469890_88ac5b4b-6a80-4156-888f-dde60e546cbe-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/29/business/29barred/merlin_144469890_88ac5b4b-6a80-4156-888f-dde60e546cbe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/29/business/29barred/merlin_144469890_88ac5b4b-6a80-4156-888f-dde60e546cbe-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/29/business/29barred/29barred-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/29/business/29barred/29barred-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/29/business/29barred/29barred-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'S.E.C. Goes After Musk With Its ‘Ultimate’ Penalty. Here’s Who Else Has Been Barred.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Executives Who Have Been Barred By S.E.C.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Musk, Elon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tesla Motors Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fines (Penalties)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-28T15:56:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amie Tsang', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tsang', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c2029d1-5fd7-5966-9638-be774afb72cc', 'word_count': 634, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c2029d1-5fd7-5966-9638-be774afb72cc'}, {'abstract': 'Hundreds were killed in the city of Palu alone, and it was feared that the toll could rise further still.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/28/world/asia/tsunami-palu-indonesia-earthquake.html', 'snippet': 'Hundreds were killed in the city of Palu alone, and it was feared that the toll could rise further still.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BANGKOK — Indonesian officials said Saturday that nearly 400 people had been killed in a strong earthquake and a tsunami on the central island of Sulawesi. Rescue workers had yet to reach some areas thought to have been affected, and it was feared that the toll could still rise.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/29/world/29tsunami-4/merlin_144536025_d4ea7a6b-fc46-4403-9263-4acef89c5f7b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/29/world/29tsunami-4/merlin_144536025_d4ea7a6b-fc46-4403-9263-4acef89c5f7b-a