fbe075e9-2f92-5134-b0bf-3801e3674fe9', 'word_count': 840, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbe075e9-2f92-5134-b0bf-3801e3674fe9'}, {'abstract': 'In the latest episode of “Make T Something,” the fashion designer pays homage to the Instagram-famous bodybuilder Jujimufu.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/28/t-magazine/adam-selman-workout-gym-crafts.html', 'snippet': 'In the latest episode of “Make T Something,” the fashion designer pays homage to the Instagram-famous bodybuilder Jujimufu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fashion designer Adam Selman is never not working on a craft project. “My boyfriend is always like, ‘No, you can’t put patches on that chair!’ ” he says; recently, at the apartment the couple shares in New York, Selman decoupaged the drawers of his antique dresser with cutouts from vintage porn magazines (“I call it ‘Grandma’s Dresser’ ”). He was an obvious candidate for T’s video series “Make T Something,” in which participants create something in under an hour using only a few select items and one object of their choosing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/t-magazine/21tmag-adam-selman-slide-BWBJ/21tmag-adam-selman-slide-BWBJ-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/21/t-magazine/21tmag-adam-selman-slide-BWBJ/21tmag-adam-selman-slide-BWBJ-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/t-magazine/21tmag-adam-selman-slide-BWBJ/21tmag-adam-selman-slide-BWBJ-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/21/t-magazine/21tmag-adam-selman-slide-BWBJ/21tmag-adam-selman-s