stract': 'Shows like “Love & Hip Hop” offer nuanced portrayals of women of color. They’re not a guilty pleasure. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/28/opinion/sunday/love-hip-hop-reality-television.html', 'snippet': 'Shows like “Love & Hip Hop” offer nuanced portrayals of women of color. They’re not a guilty pleasure. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Why do people call reality television a guilty pleasure? Why do so many reject the possibility that the trashiest of shows, like VH1’s “Love & Hip Hop,” might have a lot to tell us about society, women and power? Shows like this aren’t fluff — they’re subversive, self-aware and capable of depicting the complexities of women of color in nuanced ways. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30gates/merlin_144488769_cedebb6c-ccea-473b-91f4-1d69a5f491bd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 432, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30gates/merlin_144488769_cedebb6c-ccea-473b-91f4-1d69a5f491bd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 432}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30gates/merlin_144488769_cedebb6c-ccea-473b-91f4-1d69a5f491bd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 737, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30gates/merlin_144488769_cedebb6c-ccea-473b-91f4-1d69a5f491bd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1475, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30gates/30gates-thumbSt