ut sexual ethics. Neither is the internet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/29/opinion/sunday/sex-education-ethics-assault-boys.html', 'snippet': 'Locker rooms are not the place to learn about sexual ethics. Neither is the internet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the most stunning moments in a week of stunning moments leading up to the decision to delay the Senate vote on whether to confirm Judge Brett Kavanaugh to the Supreme Court came Friday morning, when two women confronted Senator Jeff Flake as he stood trapped in an elevator, eyes averted. If he let the nomination advance, one of them said, her voice ragged, he would be “telling all women that they don’t matter.” ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30orenstein/merlin_144488730_868e4bd4-157c-442d-a58e-cbbf21474bc1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30orenstein/merlin_144488730_868e4bd4-157c-442d-a58e-cbbf21474bc1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30orenstein/merlin_144488730_868e4bd4-157c-442d-a58e-cbbf21474bc1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30orenstein/merlin_144488730_868e4bd4-157c-442d-a58e-cbbf21474bc1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/sunday/30orenstein/30orenstein-