acks, the bureau can find out a lot about the Kavanaugh accusations in a week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The F.B.I. is back in the middle of it. When we were handed the Hillary Clinton email investigation in 2015, the bureau’s deputy director said to me, “You know you are totally screwed, right?” He meant that, in a viciously polarized political environment, one side was sure to be furious with the outcome. Sure enough, I saw a tweet declaring me “a political hack,” although the author added, tongue in cheek: “I just can’t figure out which side.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30comeyWeb/30comeyWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30comeyWeb/30comeyWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 642}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30comeyWeb/30comeyWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 958, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30comeyWeb/30comeyWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1916, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30comeyWeb/30comeyWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30comeyWeb/30comeyWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30comeyWeb/30comeyWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'James Comey: The F.B.I. Can Do This', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The F.B.I.  Can Do This', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kavanaugh, Brett M', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ford, Christine Blasey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-09-30T19:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Comey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Comey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b03c42a-fb95-541c-b0c5-10f0e451e694', 'word_count': 827, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b03c42a-fb95-541c-b0c5-10f0e451e694'}, {'abstract': 'Too many injuries prevented Wright from having a more illustrious career, but he received a glowing and deserved send-off in his final appearance as a Mets player.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/30/sports/mets-david-wright-final-game.html', 'snippet': 'Too many injuries prevented Wright from having a more illustrious career, but he received a glowing and deserved send-off in his final appearance as a Mets player.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three years ago, I roamed a pregame locker room during the Mets’ improbable sprint