orturous, deadly injection. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/09/30/opinion/death-penalty-tennessee-injection.html', 'snippet': 'Inmates on Tennessee’s death row favor a firing squad over a torturous, deadly injection. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'In August, four death row inmates filed a federal lawsuit in which they made an extraordinary argument: The state’s new lethal-injection protocol is so inhumane that execution by firing squad would be preferable. They even pointed out the practicality of this plan, noting that “the Big Buck Shooting Range is located on the grounds of Riverbend Maximum (Security) Institution and can easily accommodate the equipment required for an execution.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30renklNew/30renklNew-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 784, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30renklNew/30renklNew-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 784}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30renklNew/30renklNew-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 784, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30renklNew/30renklNew-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1567, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30renklNew/30renklNew-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/09/30/opinion/30renklNew/30renklNew-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwi